71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S-aLsyUEm5cQ7kNvwH37lR9&_nc_oc=AdriZb2OxNUq5MVpp4GJs6ccXfamGq1gVSX42Oo1WazBZF4K2fAJ8m-ueYHKE9NSbRg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_gzI9fQvF39luzP9GbC4UkpFi-3HeDMPssAKx8PYUEtg&oe=6A353FB9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0p2iRHXGOtoQ7kNvwEFbTKW&_nc_oc=AdrfK00tQ8hS0lZE3cUM_S5hMAV4Bzkm9WhxdnWRTj7GvbWCqNVvjmvixzSYMs_nw0s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af962gu3yFVZ3xvF1W6h0ORUusBbulwquEt9TkmkoC-5og&oe=6A355293"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s98VG20cCZYQ7kNvwGf7ic8&_nc_oc=AdqOehvPdhgq9IRnSIYcuGu0Ccf5ni64AVFr2zAVRWBYqjkwjFPKwvewhdPk60oQevI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9g6oGcH3Rnz7G85qtp5fr-2v9pFhYxFxTwulCIa4ZkbA&oe=6A3550DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: